msgid "内核发布规范"
msgstr "Kernel Release Rules"

msgid "版本与范围"
msgstr "Version and Scope"

msgid ""
"发布版本由本仓 configs/build-version 的版本提交确定，标签为 v<版本>。 更新范围严格为（上一版本提交，本次版本提交]。独立检查两仓历史，合并去重， "
"只汇总最终生效功能；不列版本号更新、纯 merge 或纯 gitlink 等机械条目。 本仓只写内核内容，ReliefOS 主仓独立归档自身更新。 起点不唯一时列出具体提交选项并由维护者决定。"
msgstr ""
"The release version is determined by the version commit for configs/build-version in this "
"repository, tagged v<版本>. The update range is strictly (previous version commit, current "
"version commit]. Inspect both repositories' histories independently, merge and deduplicate, and "
"summarize only features ultimately in effect. Omit mechanical entries such as version bumps, pure "
"merges, and pure gitlink changes. This repository documents only kernel changes; the ReliefOS main"
" repository archives its own updates separately. If the starting point is ambiguous, list specific"
" commit choices for a maintainer to decide."

msgid "说明与验证"
msgstr "Notes and Validation"

msgid ""
"正文依次包含“更新内容”“破坏性更新”“更新与迁移注意事项”“开发者提示”。 破坏性更新明确写是、否或尚未确认，列明路径、ABI、数据或工作流影响。 本仓规范原文归档为 "
"Documentation/releases/<版本>.rst；GitHub Release 使用 经审阅、内容相同的 Markdown 正文文件，可暂存在输出目录，不新增第二套手册。 "
"源码发布不附二进制；只有明确选择时才从本版本重建并附校验和及归属。"
msgstr ""
"The body contains, in order, “Changes”, “Breaking Changes”, “Update and Migration Notes”, and "
"“Developer Notes”. State breaking changes explicitly as yes, no, or unconfirmed, with path, ABI, "
"data, or workflow impacts. The canonical source is archived as "
"Documentation/releases/<版本>.rst in this repository. GitHub Release uses a reviewed Markdown "
"body file with identical content, which may temporarily reside in output; do not add a second "
"manual. Source releases contain no binaries; only when explicitly selected, rebuild binaries from "
"this version and attach checksums and attribution."

msgid "核对内核版本生成、字符串与数字宏；不改变 ABI golden 或音频策略 掩盖失败。编译、打包、QEMU、VMware 逐层报告，未验证明确注明。"
msgstr ""
"Check kernel version generation, strings, and numeric macros; do not change ABI golden data or "
"audio policy to conceal failures. Report compilation, packaging, QEMU, and VMware separately, "
"explicitly identifying unvalidated stages."

msgid "提交与发布顺序"
msgstr "Commit and Release Order"

msgid ""
"只有用户明确授权才提交、推送、建分支或发布。先提交验证并推送 ReliefNT， 再更新父仓 gitlink、提交推送 ReliefOS。标签指向各自完整版本提交 SHA， "
"不能误用默认分支或擅自合并开发分支。已有标签和 Release 不静默重写。"
msgstr ""
"Commit, push, create branches, or publish only with explicit user authorization. Commit, validate,"
" and push ReliefNT first, then update the parent gitlink and commit/push ReliefOS. Tags point to "
"each repository's full version-commit SHA; do not accidentally use the default branch or merge "
"development branches without authorization. Never silently rewrite existing tags or Releases."

msgid ""
"通过 gh release create 的 verify-tag、target 和 notes-file 参数发布；预发布 另标 "
"prerelease。回读确认标签解析的提交、正文、状态及附件，不以命令已发出 替代发布成功。"
msgstr ""
"Publish with the verify-tag, target, and notes-file parameters of gh release create; mark "
"prereleases with prerelease as well. Read back and confirm the tag's resolved commit, body, "
"status, and attachments; issuing the command alone does not prove publication succeeded."
